{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19263","headline":"海阳湖别浩初师 · 刘禹锡","name":"海阳湖别浩初师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"近郭看殊境，独游常鲜懽。\n逢君驻缁锡，观貌称林峦。\n湖满景方霁，野香春未阑。\n爱泉移席近，闻石辍棊看。\n风止松犹韵，花繁露未乾。\n桥形出树曲，岩影落池寒别路千嶂里，诗情暮云端。\n他年买山处，似此得隳官。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}